# CSR writes are serializing and commit-gated (ADR-004 as re-based by ADR-019): a CSR
# write on the wrong path of an unpredicted taken branch must never change the CSR.
@name ooo-wrong-path-csr-write-invisible
@verifies propNoSpeculativeCsrWrite funcSerializeGate funcSerializingTag
@maxcycles 4000
li x5, 0x11
li x6, 0x22
csrrw x0, mscratch, x5
beq x0, x0, skip
csrrw x0, mscratch, x6
skip: csrrs x7, mscratch, x0
check x7 == 0x11
